# A noise request during the earthquake song ($0E) is dropped, and for that
# tick nothing on the noise channel plays either. tick 0: the earthquake;
# tick 30: a bomb ($0C), dropped. tick 60: silence ($FF); tick 70: an enemy
# killed ($02), which plays; tick 75: the earthquake again, and tick 78 an
# enemy shot ($01), dropped, while $02 plays on under the song. Three seconds.
[songRequest=0E]
